# UI Spec (`apps/ui-spec`)

**Do not use Figma** for UI design or frontend implementation in this repo. The canonical UI constraint library is `apps/ui-spec`.

## When to read

Before designing screens (`ui-designer`) or implementing UI (`nextjs-frontend`), read:

1. `apps/ui-spec/README.md` — overview and usage
2. `apps/ui-spec/src/app/globals.css` — design tokens (colors, radius, sidebar)
3. `apps/ui-spec/components.json` — shadcn style (`base-nova`), icon library (`lucide`)
4. `apps/ui-spec/src/app/page.tsx` — component showcase (variants, composition patterns)
5. `apps/ui-spec/src/components/ui/*.tsx` — allowed primitives and their APIs

Run locally: `pnpm --filter @meridian/ui-spec dev` (if configured) or `cd apps/ui-spec && pnpm dev`.

## Rules

- **Components:** Only use primitives defined in `apps/ui-spec/src/components/ui/`. Map to `packages/ui` or app `components/ui/` — keep APIs aligned with ui-spec.
- **Tokens:** Match CSS variables from `apps/ui-spec/src/app/globals.css`. Do not invent one-off hex colors.
- **Variants:** Follow showcase usage in `page.tsx` (Button, Badge, Table, Dialog, Sheet, etc.).
- **Icons:** `lucide-react` per ui-spec `components.json` (portals may use `@tabler/icons-react` in shells only if already established in `packages/ui`).
- **No Figma MCP:** Do not call Figma tools, sync to Figma, or block on Figma node IDs.

## Portal implementation

| Layer | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Spec (source) | `apps/ui-spec/` |
| Shared shells & composites | `packages/ui/` |
| App routes & feature UI | `apps/admin/`, `apps/merchant/`, `apps/store/` |
| Screen wireframes | `docs/design/<feature>.md` |

Design docs describe layout and behavior; visual constraints come from ui-spec.
